@startuml architecture-globale
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
title Architecture globale - Mutuelle ENSPY (production)

actor "Membre / Bureau" as User

cloud "Internet" as Internet

node "Serveur VPS / Cloud" as VPS {
  component "Nginx\n(reverse proxy + TLS)" as Nginx

  folder "Frontend (build statique)" as FE {
    [index.html]
    [assets JS/CSS]
    [PWA manifest + SW]
  }

  node "Docker / JVM" as Docker {
    component "Spring Boot API\nport 8080" as API
    database "MySQL 8\nport 3306" as DB
  }

  component "Adminer\n(optionnel)" as Adminer
}

User --> Internet : HTTPS
Internet --> Nginx
Nginx --> FE : GET / assets
Nginx --> API : proxy /api/*
API --> DB : JDBC
Adminer ..> DB : admin SQL interne

note right of Nginx
  Recommande en production
  - Un seul domaine
  - VITE_API_BASE_URL vide
  - Certificat Let's Encrypt
  - SSE : proxy_buffering off
end note

@enduml
